WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.766
Step seven reads the evidence:
eighteen decisions in seven instances,

2
00:00:04.766 --> 00:00:07.287
with seven findings and two warnings.

3
00:00:07.287 --> 00:00:11.987
E oh one: the Privileged Role Administrator
series isn't in the tenant yet.

4
00:00:11.987 --> 00:00:14.852
E oh two: the Tier 0 Global Administrator

5
00:00:14.852 --> 00:00:18.063
group's series has no
closed instance in time.

6
00:00:18.063 --> 00:00:22.708
E oh eight: a reviewer denied
Emergency Access 02 in October,

7
00:00:22.708 --> 00:00:25.837
the finding this module exists to catch.

8
00:00:25.837 --> 00:00:31.429
E oh four: an item nobody reviewed,
decided by the no-response default;

9
00:00:31.429 --> 00:00:34.425
a finding on Tier 0, a warning on Tier 1.

10
00:00:34.425 --> 00:00:37.863
E oh five: an approval
without a justification.

11
00:00:37.863 --> 00:00:41.349
E oh three: a denial whose
result wasn't applied.

12
00:00:41.349 --> 00:00:44.525
E oh six: someone reviewed
their own access.

13
00:00:44.525 --> 00:00:49.883
And E oh seven: one reviewer recorded a
run of identical decisions within minutes,

14
00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:53.230
